DAT
id=qid::label=str::text=lstr::
12364::$$$message_0099_0000_0000$$$::...This is a sudden question, but...[lr]::
12365::$$$message_0099_0000_0001$$$::I wonder how the Matou family is doing, having their excellent housekeeper's time taken up by the Emiya household.::
12366::$$$message_0099_0001_0000$$$::"So, what do you usually eat?"[lr]::
12367::$$$message_0099_0001_0001$$$::"Ahahaha. You're asking quite the question coming here without an appointment, mister.[lr]::
12368::$$$message_0099_0001_0002$$$::I would've hung you if you weren't an old childhood friend."::
12369::$$$message_0099_0002_0000$$$::Shinji Matou breaks into a broad smile, like a gentleman.[lr]::
12370::$$$message_0099_0002_0001$$$::As expected of a pampered, bourgeois boy.::
12371::$$$message_0099_0003_0000$$$::"So. What are you actually here for, Emiya? You didn't come here to ask something that doesn't matter like that, right?"[lr]::
12372::$$$message_0099_0003_0001$$$::"It doesn't not matter. Since Sakura helps us make dinner, I can't find the words to apologize if your family's dinner is being neglected."::
12373::$$$message_0099_0004_0000$$$::"Ah, I see. You always seem to worry about unnecessary things."[lr]::
12374::$$$message_0099_0004_0001$$$::Shinji laughs dryly.[lr]::
12375::$$$message_0099_0004_0002$$$::His cynicism doesn't have its usual kick.::
12376::$$$message_0099_0005_0000$$$::"You don't seem like yourself today, Shinji. Are you not eating meals properly without Sakura after all?"[lr]::
12377::$$$message_0099_0005_0001$$$::"Yeah right. We have a hired housekeeper cooking our meals. [cacheimage storage=慎二制服01c(中)][wvl canskip=0 time=300][chgfg textoff=0 time=200 storage=慎二制服01c(中)]Well, I was mostly eating out, and the housekeeper was looking after our grandfather."::
12378::$$$message_0099_0006_0000$$$::"Wow. You had a housekeeper?"[lr]::
12379::$$$message_0099_0006_0001$$$::"...Yeah. Our mansion is bigger than Tohsaka's. We can't manage the entire place without one or two housekeepers.[wvs][wait canskip=0 time=300][lr]::
12380::$$$message_0099_0006_0002$$$::Sakura also was leaving all the housework up to the housekeepers until she started going to your place."::
12381::$$$message_0099_0007_0000$$$::Hm, that's unexpected... Well actually, I guess not.[lr]::
12382::$$$message_0099_0007_0001$$$::She only learned how to cook once she got to the Emiya household.[lr]::
12383::$$$message_0099_0007_0002$$$::I remember she used to cry, not being able to make rice balls well at first.::
12384::$$$message_0099_0008_0000$$$::"But, that was until recently, right? Sakura can make anything. She's better than me when it comes to laundry and cooking.[lr]::
12385::$$$message_0099_0008_0001$$$::She goes home sometimes, so doesn't she cook then?"[lr]::
12386::$$$message_0099_0008_0002$$$::"..."::
12387::$$$message_0099_0009_0000$$$::His right to remain silent is activated.[lr]::
12388::$$$message_0099_0009_0001$$$::Shinji goes silent, like a criminal who was cornered.[lr]::
12389::$$$message_0099_0009_0002$$$::Like he wants to confess and feel better, but he's scared about what's to follow if he says it.::
12390::$$$message_0099_0010_0000$$$::"...That bothers me.[lr]::
12391::$$$message_0099_0010_0001$$$::Well, that's fine if you're eating meals properly. Where is that housekeeper?"[lr]::
12392::$$$message_0099_0010_0002$$$::"She quit. Freaking Sakura made her quit, saying that we aren't kids anymore so we don't need her."::
12393::$$$message_0099_0011_0000$$$::"..."[lr]::
12394::$$$message_0099_0011_0001$$$::Sakura's point is true.[lr]::
12395::$$$message_0099_0011_0002$$$::Sakura is correct, but the Sakura that Shinji describes is making me apprehensive.::
12396::$$$message_0099_0012_0000$$$::"...Hey, Shinji. Could it be that Sakura doesn't cook here?"[lr]::
12397::$$$message_0099_0012_0001$$$::"...Heh. What an amateur. That's the naïvety of someone who has never seen hell before. Did you know that real fear isn't taking away, but giving?"[lr]::
12398::$$$message_0099_0012_0002$$$::"...I don't really get it, or like don't really want to think about it deeply, but can I assume that Sakura does all the housework?"::
12399::$$$message_0099_0013_0000$$$::"On a rate of once every two days. When it's the days that you're in charge of meals, she makes meals and does the laundry here. Since she's making dinner, I'm waiting at home."[lr]::
12400::$$$message_0099_0013_0001$$$::"Huh??? That makes even less sense. Isn't that a good thing? Why have you been trembling, Shinji?"::
12401::$$$message_0099_0014_0000$$$::"It goes without saying![cacheimage storage=慎二制服03a(中)][wvl][shock vmax=10 time=400 count=-3][chgfg textoff=0 pos=c time=300 storage=慎二制服03a(中)] I'm trembling because I'm scared! It's terrifying! Aren't you scared, Emiya!? It's Sakura! It's eating the food that Sakura made!"[lr]::
12402::$$$message_0099_0014_0001$$$::"..."[lr]::
12403::$$$message_0099_0014_0002$$$::Hmmm. If it was my usual self, I would've punched him, telling him, "Don't say something rude like that, stupid brother!" But Shinji's fear is 100% that of a victim's.::
12404::$$$message_0099_0015_0000$$$::"...What? Is Sakura's food not good?"[lr]::
12405::$$$message_0099_0015_0001$$$::"No, it's not bad. I don't say it in front of her face, but it tastes better than some random family restaurant."::
12406::$$$message_0099_0016_0000$$$::"Well, it's too much of a commoner's taste so it doesn't match my taste buds. No matter how elaborate of a meal she cooks, Sakura is Sakura after all, hah."[lr]::
12407::$$$message_0099_0016_0001$$$::...And no matter how scared he might be, Shinji is Shinji.[lr]::
12408::$$$message_0099_0016_0002$$$::I wonder if this is what you call brotherly love.::
12409::$$$message_0099_0017_0000$$$::"Well, that aside...[lr]::
12410::$$$message_0099_0017_0001$$$::Then, what are you unhappy about? It's starting to sound like you're bragging about your little sister."[lr]::
12411::$$$message_0099_0017_0002$$$::"No way.[lr]::
12412::$$$message_0099_0017_0003$$$::I wouldn't brag about Sakura even by accident. What I'm talking about is not the taste of her food, but Sakura's attitude."::
12413::$$$message_0099_0018_0000$$$::"...Yeah. I'll ask since this is a good opportunity.[lr]::
12414::$$$message_0099_0018_0001$$$::Don't you feel her eyes on you when you're eating her food?"::
12415::$$$message_0099_0019_0000$$$::"Her eyes...? No, I don't. Do you?"[lr]::
12416::$$$message_0099_0019_0001$$$::"Not just feel, but they pierce through. She's too sensitive when it comes to table manners.[lr]::
12417::$$$message_0099_0019_0002$$$::She'll look away unhappily when I leave some salad, [cacheimage storage=慎二制服01g(中)][wvl canskip=0 time=80][chgfg textoff=0 time=300 storage=慎二制服01g(中)]get disappointed when I eat fish with a spoon, [cacheimage storage=慎二制服04a(中)][wvl canskip=0 time=100][chgfg textoff=0 time=300 storage=慎二制服04a(中)]and will complain when I don't help clean up afterwards.[lr]::
12418::$$$message_0099_0019_0003$$$::Geez, is she a child?"::
12419::$$$message_0099_0020_0000$$$::"You're the child, idiot. Anyone would get mad, not just Sakura. It can't be helped to leave what you don't like, but you should at least help clean up. If you do that, then Sakura wouldn't complain."[lr]::
12420::$$$message_0099_0020_0001$$$::"..."::
12421::$$$message_0099_0021_0000$$$::"You're the one that's at fault overall. I won't stop defending Sakura."[lr]::
12422::$$$message_0099_0021_0001$$$::"...You can say that since you don't know what that atmosphere is like. [cacheimage storage=慎二制服01c(中)][wvl canskip=0 time=300][chgfg textoff=0 time=300 storage=慎二制服01c(中)]You're lucky the gathering at your place seems unnecessarily warm.[lr]::
12423::$$$message_0099_0021_0002$$$::Over here, it's miserable because of Sakura. Like it can't get any colder, it's absolute zero.[lr]::
12424::$$$message_0099_0021_0003$$$::My grandfather would lock himself up in his room, saying that unmicrowaved frozen food is better."::
12425::$$$message_0099_0022_0000$$$::"That's because Zouken is wasting her food, right? Sakura wouldn't get mad if he thanked her properly."[lr]::
12426::$$$message_0099_0022_0001$$$::"Hah, say what you want... [cacheimage storage=慎二制服01c(中)][wvl canskip=0 time=300][chgfg textoff=0 time=300 storage=慎二制服01c(中)]Heh, yeah. If you're going to say that much, then see for yourself, Emiya."[lr]::
12427::$$$message_0099_0022_0002$$$::"Huh?"::
12428::$$$message_0099_0023_0000$$$::"Don't 'huh' me. I was too scared to go check until now, but I feel like I can manage if you're with me.[lr]::
12429::$$$message_0099_0023_0001$$$::You're going to defend Sakura, right? Then, let's go check together, man."::
12430::$$$message_0099_0024_0000$$$::[font italic=true]Don't "man" me.[font italic=false][lr]::
12431::$$$message_0099_0024_0001$$$::[font italic=true]Check what together?[font italic=false]::
12432::$$$message_0099_0025_0000$$$::"Sakura's room. It seems like she has a diary. If we look at that, we can tell what she thinks about us, right?"[lr]::
12433::$$$message_0099_0025_0001$$$::"Wha[line len=2]"[lr]::
12434::$$$message_0099_0025_0002$$$::No, peeking into someone's diary isn't good no matter what.[lr]::
12435::$$$message_0099_0025_0003$$$::On top of that, sneaking into Sakura's room isn't good (for both of our lives).::
12436::$$$message_0099_0026_0000$$$::"You're not gonna say no, are you, Emiya? First of all, this happened because you trained Sakura in housework.[lr]::
12437::$$$message_0099_0026_0001$$$::Had she not learned how to cook, our dining table would've been peaceful. Take responsibility for your student as a teacher."[lr]::
12438::$$$message_0099_0026_0002$$$::"No, it's not my responsibility[line len=2]"::
12439::$$$message_0099_0027_0000$$$::"Yeah, it is![lr]::
12440::$$$message_0099_0027_0001$$$::Sakura is clumsy to start with. Not having someone like her do anything is for the sake of the world!"::
12441::$$$message_0099_0028_0000$$$::"B-But since you egg her on, Grandfather and I have to tremble like chickens at a poultry farm...![cacheimage storage=慎二制服05b(近)][wvl canskip=0 time=300][se storage=se040.wav][shock vmax=30 time=500 count=-3][chgfg textoff=0 pos=c time=300 storage=慎二制服05b(近)] Ugh, I'm already at my limit! Hey Emiya, if you saved Sakura, save us too!"::
12442::$$$message_0099_0029_0000$$$::Shinji leans over me like a zombie.[lr]::
12443::$$$message_0099_0029_0001$$$::His acting isn't funny in the dim Matou house.::
12444::$$$message_0099_0030_0000$$$::"O-[wvl][shock vmax=10 time=400 count=-3]Okay, I got it, so let go![lr]::
12445::$$$message_0099_0030_0001$$$::...Geez. You're overthinking, Shinji. Fine, I'll keep you company.[lr]::
12446::$$$message_0099_0030_0002$$$::But under one condition. Even if Sakura's diary is in there, stop what you're thinking if it says that she wishes you'd helped out. Then it's an amicable resolution."::
12447::$$$message_0099_0031_0000$$$::"Mrgh... [cacheimage storage=慎二制服01g(中)][wvl][chgfg textoff=0 time=300 storage=慎二制服01g(中)]Fine. It's a bit irritating, but I'll do that much for you."[lr]::
12448::$$$message_0099_0031_0001$$$::"All right. It's a promise, Shinji."[lr]::
12449::$$$message_0099_0031_0002$$$::Then it would benefit Sakura.[lr]::
12450::$$$message_0099_0031_0003$$$::If Shinji would help out with the housework from this, I couldn't ask for more.[lr]::
12451::$$$message_0099_0031_0004$$$::Sakura would overlook an act of barbarity such as sneaking into a girl's room without consent...right?::
12452::$$$message_0099_0032_0000$$$::We go up the stairs of the Matou house that is dark even during the daytime.[lr]::
12453::$$$message_0099_0032_0001$$$::Shinji is pale.[lr]::
12454::$$$message_0099_0032_0002$$$::Even though he's the one who suggested we go check, he seems like he's about to run away if he has the chance.::
12455::$$$message_0099_0033_0000$$$::"...Emiya. There's one thing I forgot to mention."[lr]::
12456::$$$message_0099_0033_0001$$$::In front of Sakura's room.[lr]::
12457::$$$message_0099_0033_0002$$$::Shinji whispers in front of the door which is firmly locked.::
12458::$$$message_0099_0034_0000$$$::"Sakura's room has had this weird Bounded Field set up since half a year ago and according to Grandfather, it's magecraft taught by Rider. He said to be careful since we won't make it out alive."[lr]::
12459::$$$message_0099_0034_0001$$$::"What?"[lr]::
12460::$$$message_0099_0034_0002$$$::[font italic=true]What is this foreshadowing like a bad ending flag?[font italic=false]::
12461::$$$message_0099_0035_0000$$$::"H-Hold on, this isn't what I agreed to! I only agreed to check Sakura's diary with you...!"::
12462::$$$message_0099_0036_0000$$$::"Hahahaha! How silly, did you think I would come crying to you over something like that!? Apparently Sakura will know the moment an intruder comes in! But if you're the accomplice, I don't think she'd be able to put her foot down!"[lr]::
12463::$$$message_0099_0036_0001$$$::The school's idol dances around, laughing in desperation.::
12464::$$$message_0099_0037_0000$$$::"You planned this, didn't you, Shinji!?"[lr]::
12465::$$$message_0099_0037_0001$$$::But little Shinji doesn't get it at all.[lr]::
12466::$$$message_0099_0037_0002$$$::When Miss Sakura gets mad, she gets mad, no matter who it is.[lr]::
12467::$$$message_0099_0037_0003$$$::Wouldn't this be something irreparable if I were the accomplice in this situation...!?::
12468::$$$message_0099_0038_0000$$$::"...Wait. It's not any different than before."[lr]::
12469::$$$message_0099_0038_0001$$$::Shinji looks around the room.[lr]::
12470::$$$message_0099_0038_0002$$$::He must've decided that nothing is unusual from only ten seconds of investigating.[lr]::
12471::$$$message_0099_0038_0003$$$::"Tsk, I got nervous for nothing. I should've sneaked in sooner if it was like this."[lr]::
12472::$$$message_0099_0038_0004$$$::Shinji violently storms into the room.::
12473::$$$message_0099_0039_0000$$$::"...Shinji. What you lack the most is being cautious."[lr]::
12474::$$$message_0099_0039_0001$$$::I follow him without a choice, paying utmost attention.[lr]::
12475::$$$message_0099_0039_0002$$$::There is no time.[lr]::
12476::$$$message_0099_0039_0003$$$::If what Shinji said is true, Sakura must've noticed the intruders.[lr]::
12477::$$$message_0099_0039_0004$$$::If Sakura was at the Emiya house, it would take thirty minutes to get to the Matou house sprinting at full speed.[lr]::
12478::$$$message_0099_0039_0005$$$::We must finish our plan within thirty minutes, retreat as far as we can, and make an alibi...!::
12479::$$$message_0099_0040_0000$$$::"Shinji, let's search the desk first."[lr]::
12480::$$$message_0099_0040_0001$$$::If there's a diary, then it should be on the desk.[lr]::
12481::$$$message_0099_0040_0002$$$::If it isn't there, then it would no longer be a diary. Hidden away, it would be something more terrifying.::
12482::$$$message_0099_0041_0000$$$::"Oh, I'll leave the desk area to you. I'll search in the closet over here."[lr]::
12483::$$$message_0099_0041_0001$$$::"..."[lr]::
12484::$$$message_0099_0041_0002$$$::There's a lot I want to say, but everything will be over once we find the diary.::
12485::$$$message_0099_0042_0000$$$::...Fun Home Economics for Beginners.[lr]::
12486::$$$message_0099_0042_0001$$$::Not this.[lr]::
12487::$$$message_0099_0042_0002$$$::...Easy Pöeling in Three Minutes.[lr]::
12488::$$$message_0099_0042_0003$$$::Not this.[lr]::
12489::$$$message_0099_0042_0004$$$::...How to Relieve Your Stress That You Can't Tell Anyone About![lr]::
12490::$$$message_0099_0042_0005$$$::Not this.[lr]::
12491::$$$message_0099_0042_0006$$$::...One Hundred Common Pitfalls of Chinese Food! Beat Chinese Food Chefs Like This![lr]::
12492::$$$message_0099_0042_0007$$$::Not this.[lr]::
12493::$$$message_0099_0042_0008$$$::...The End of Elderly Care. Squeezing the Neck.[lr]::
12494::$$$message_0099_0042_0009$$$::Not this either.::
12495::$$$message_0099_0043_0000$$$::"...I can't find anything like it... Shinji, how are you doing over there?"[lr]::
12496::$$$message_0099_0043_0001$$$::"...What's with this size? Freaking Sakura's still growing?"[lr]::
12497::$$$message_0099_0043_0002$$$::A bad big brother checking her bra size, saying it's disgraceful.[lr]::
12498::$$$message_0099_0043_0003$$$::Hahaha. If someone got a photo of us in this situation, we wouldn't be able to disobey that person for the rest of our lives.::
12499::$$$message_0099_0044_0000$$$::"Don't fool around! It's been ten minutes already. If we can't find it in the next ten minutes, we're withdrawing!"[lr]::
12500::$$$message_0099_0044_0001$$$::"Okay, I know. If we don't see it on her desk or in the closet, then that only leaves under the bed[line len=2]"[lr]::
12501::$$$message_0099_0044_0002$$$::Shinji removes a painting off the wall.[se storage=se190.wav]::
12502::$$$message_0099_0045_0000$$$::"Oh?"[lr]::
12503::$$$message_0099_0045_0001$$$::"Mrgh?"[lr]::
12504::$$$message_0099_0045_0002$$$::He found it.[lr]::
12505::$$$message_0099_0045_0003$$$::The notebook that was hidden behind the painting falls to our feet.::
12506::$$$message_0099_0046_0000$$$::"Geez, that idiot really doesn't think about anything![lr]::
12507::$$$message_0099_0046_0001$$$::Hiding it in a place like this is like asking for it to be found!"[lr]::
12508::$$$message_0099_0046_0002$$$::"Well, there are no robbers that come into the Matou house. I still think she's being pretty mindful even with this."::
12509::$$$message_0099_0047_0000$$$::We both say what we want and shift our focus to the floor.[lr]::
12510::$$$message_0099_0047_0001$$$::There is...[lr]::
12511::$$$message_0099_0047_0002$$$::"...Huh?"[lr]::
12512::$$$message_0099_0047_0003$$$::I see something ominous.::
12513::$$$message_0099_0048_0000$$$::"O-oh my, could this notebook be that rumored notebook where the people whose names you write down get assassinated!?"[lr]::
12514::$$$message_0099_0048_0001$$$::Shinji screams.[lr]::
12515::$$$message_0099_0048_0002$$$::He's started speaking like some princess out of shock.::
12516::$$$message_0099_0049_0000$$$::"No, this is slightly different...but I wonder why. This is my first time seeing it, yet it looks familiar."[lr]::
12517::$$$message_0099_0049_0001$$$::...I pick up the notebook.[lr]::
12518::$$$message_0099_0049_0002$$$::We need to check to see if this is what we're looking for.::
12519::$$$message_0099_0050_0000$$$::"...Hey, show it to me, too. I don't want to see it, but not seeing it is even more scary."::
12520::$$$message_0099_0051_0000$$$::[whitecircle]/[whitecircle] Weather: Sunny [whitestar][lr]::
12521::$$$message_0099_0051_0001$$$::Here's what happened today.[lr]::
12522::$$$message_0099_0051_0002$$$::Shinji came home past midnight.[lr]::
12523::$$$message_0099_0051_0003$$$::I'll tell him to let me know beforehand when I make dinner from now on.::
12524::$$$message_0099_0052_0000$$$::[whitecircle]/[whitecircle] Weather: Sunny [whitestar][lr]::
12525::$$$message_0099_0052_0001$$$::Here's what happened today.[lr]::
12526::$$$message_0099_0052_0002$$$::Shinji is leaving his dirty laundry around.[lr]::
12527::$$$message_0099_0052_0003$$$::I'll leave a note on how to use the laundry machine next time.::
12528::$$$message_0099_0053_0000$$$::[whitecircle]/[whitecircle] Weather: Sunny [whitestar][lr]::
12529::$$$message_0099_0053_0001$$$::Here's what happened today.[lr]::
12530::$$$message_0099_0053_0002$$$::Shinji is taking out a lot of money.[lr]::
12531::$$$message_0099_0053_0003$$$::I'll let him know about the maximum limit next time.::
12532::$$$message_0099_0054_0000$$$::There's little reminders in the notebook.::
12533::$$$message_0099_0055_0000$$$::"Oh. It's an entirely reasonable diary."[lr]::
12534::$$$message_0099_0055_0001$$$::"You think so?"[lr]::
12535::$$$message_0099_0055_0002$$$::"Yeah. It's totally like Sakura. She was just warning you like she said in the diary, right?"::
12536::$$$message_0099_0056_0000$$$::"Ah... Come to think of it, I do feel like she was nitpicking at me. Like she'll make dinner today or she wants me to take out my dirty laundry or that our monthly allowance is up to twenty thousand yen.[lr]::
12537::$$$message_0099_0056_0001$$$::Hahaha, I forgot since she was being annoying."::
12538::$$$message_0099_0057_0000$$$::"Dude, it's only natural that Sakura is sulking.[lr]::
12539::$$$message_0099_0057_0001$$$::She's still doing the housework admirably, so there's nothing wrong with her.[lr]::
12540::$$$message_0099_0057_0002$$$::I got scared too since you were strangely scared, but Sakura is like usual. Just as promised, you should help out with the housework too."::
12541::$$$message_0099_0058_0000$$$::"...Heh. It's a hassle, but it's a promise.[lr]::
12542::$$$message_0099_0058_0001$$$::Fine, if you're saying that's my fault, then I'll at least help out."::
12543::$$$message_0099_0059_0000$$$::Shinji accepts the condition reluctantly.[lr]::
12544::$$$message_0099_0059_0001$$$::If this was the result of sneaking into Sakura's room and even committing a rash act such as peeking in her diary then... [font italic=true]Wait, what? [font italic=false]::
12545::$$$message_0099_0060_0000$$$::"What, why do you look like you've seen a ghost? Don't intimidate me like that."[lr]::
12546::$$$message_0099_0060_0001$$$::"..."[lr]::
12547::$$$message_0099_0060_0002$$$::I turn the page silently.[lr]::
12548::$$$message_0099_0060_0003$$$::It seems like there was still more to the notebook.::
12549::$$$message_0099_0061_0000$$$::[whitecircle]/[whitecircle] Weather: Sunny [whitestar][lr]::
12550::$$$message_0099_0061_0001$$$::Here is what happened today.[lr]::
12551::$$$message_0099_0061_0002$$$::Shinji spilled soy sauce on my clothes that I had just bought.[lr]::
12552::$$$message_0099_0061_0003$$$::He apologizes while smiling saying, "Sorry, it didn't go well."[lr]::
12553::$$$message_0099_0061_0004$$$::Apologizing is fine, but I wonder what didn't go well.::
12554::$$$message_0099_0062_0000$$$::[whitecircle]/[whitecircle] Weather: Sunny [whitestar][lr]::
12555::$$$message_0099_0062_0001$$$::Here is what happened today.[lr]::
12556::$$$message_0099_0062_0002$$$::Grandfather complains, saying that I'm bad at remembering things, and if I'm like this, he should've chosen my older sister.[lr]::
12557::$$$message_0099_0062_0003$$$::...I feel sorry towards my grandfather for not being able to get better at magecraft.::
12558::$$$message_0099_0063_0000$$$::[whitecircle]/[whitecircle] Weather: Sunny [whitestar][whitestar][lr]::
12559::$$$message_0099_0063_0001$$$::Here is what happened today.[lr]::
12560::$$$message_0099_0063_0002$$$::Shinji didn't eat any of his omurice.[lr]::
12561::$$$message_0099_0063_0003$$$::I don't know why. Even if I ask him, he just keeps on mumbling.[lr]::
12562::$$$message_0099_0063_0004$$$::I wonder what I should do.::
12563::$$$message_0099_0064_0000$$$::[whitecircle]/[whitecircle] Weather: Sunny [whitestar][lr]::
12564::$$$message_0099_0064_0001$$$::Here is what happened today.[lr]::
12565::$$$message_0099_0064_0002$$$::Grandfather keeps on ringing his bell during the night.[lr]::
12566::$$$message_0099_0064_0003$$$::I thought he needed to go to the restroom, but he was just hitting it over and over again in his sleep. Even though I still ran over, he kept repeating that he prefers my older sister.[lr]::
12567::$$$message_0099_0064_0004$$$::What should I do?::
12568::$$$message_0099_0065_0000$$$::[whitecircle]/[whitecircle] Weather: Sunny [whitestar][whitestar][lr]::
12569::$$$message_0099_0065_0001$$$::Here is what happened today.[lr]::
12570::$$$message_0099_0065_0002$$$::Shinji threw away the dinner that I made.[lr]::
12571::$$$message_0099_0065_0003$$$::I don't know why. Even if I ask him, he just keeps on mumbling.[lr]::
12572::$$$message_0099_0065_0004$$$::I really don't know what I should do.::
12573::$$$message_0099_0066_0000$$$::[whitecircle]/[whitecircle] Weather: Sunny [whitestar][whitestar][lr]::
12574::$$$message_0099_0066_0001$$$::Here is what happened today.[lr]::
12575::$$$message_0099_0066_0002$$$::Shinji dropped coffee gum into the stewpot.[lr]::
12576::$$$message_0099_0066_0003$$$::I've been thinking about what the reason may be until now, but there might not be any reason.::
12577::$$$message_0099_0067_0000$$$::[whitecircle]/[whitecircle] Weather: Sunny [whitestar][whitestar][whitestar][lr]::
12578::$$$message_0099_0067_0001$$$::Here is what happened today.[lr]::
12579::$$$message_0099_0067_0002$$$::Shinji ate all of our dinner without telling me.[lr]::
12580::$$$message_0099_0067_0003$$$::I was waiting until Shinji came home, so I had to skip dinner today.[lr]::
12581::$$$message_0099_0067_0004$$$::My stomach was growling.::
12582::$$$message_0099_0068_0000$$$::"..."[lr]::
12583::$$$message_0099_0068_0001$$$::"..."[lr]::
12584::$$$message_0099_0068_0002$$$::I turn the page like I'm being hurried by something.[lr]::
12585::$$$message_0099_0068_0003$$$::This is dangerous.[lr]::
12586::$$$message_0099_0068_0004$$$::I shouldn't look past this.[lr]::
12587::$$$message_0099_0068_0005$$$::Really, I should throw out this notebook right away and run away from the Matou house, but I can't stop turning the pages.::
12588::$$$message_0099_0069_0000$$$::[whitecircle]/[whitecircle] Weather: Sunny [whitestar][whitestar][whitestar][whitestar][lr]::
12589::$$$message_0099_0069_0001$$$::It seems like Shinji is actually making it in time for dinner lately.[lr]::
12590::$$$message_0099_0069_0002$$$::This is a very good thing.[lr]::
12591::$$$message_0099_0069_0003$$$::Here is what happened today.[lr]::
12592::$$$message_0099_0069_0004$$$::He forgot to say, "Thank you for the dinner."::
12593::$$$message_0099_0070_0000$$$::[whitecircle]/[whitecircle] Weather: Sunny [whitestar][whitestar][whitestar][whitestar][lr]::
12594::$$$message_0099_0070_0001$$$::Here is what happened today.[lr]::
12595::$$$message_0099_0070_0002$$$::Grandfather hired a new housekeeper but is pulling pranks on her and making her cry.[lr]::
12596::$$$message_0099_0070_0003$$$::I think that something is wrong with the men of the Matou bloodline. I think I'll change my mindset a bit too.::
12597::$$$message_0099_0071_0000$$$::[whitecircle]/[whitecircle] Weather: Sunny [whitestar][whitestar][whitestar][whitestar][lr]::
12598::$$$message_0099_0071_0001$$$::Here is what happened today.[lr]::
12599::$$$message_0099_0071_0002$$$::My brother left a piece of lettuce and one tomato.::
12600::$$$message_0099_0072_0000$$$::[whitecircle]/[whitecircle] Weather: Sunny [whitestar][whitestar][whitestar][whitestar][whitestar][lr]::
12601::$$$message_0099_0072_0001$$$::My brother today.[lr]::
12602::$$$message_0099_0072_0002$$$::He clicks his tongue while we eat. I don't think he should do that.::
12603::$$$message_0099_0073_0000$$$::[whitecircle]/[whitecircle] Weather: Sunny [whitestar][whitestar][whitestar][whitestar][whitestar][lr]::
12604::$$$message_0099_0073_0001$$$::My grandfather today.[lr]::
12605::$$$message_0099_0073_0002$$$::He ate udon while lying down and spit it out. I want him to stop.::
12606::$$$message_0099_0074_0000$$$::[whitecircle]/[whitecircle] Weather: Sunny [whitestar][whitestar][whitestar][whitestar][whitestar][lr]::
12607::$$$message_0099_0074_0001$$$::My brother today.[lr]::
12608::$$$message_0099_0074_0002$$$::He came home two minutes late. I don't think there'll be a next time.::
12609::$$$message_0099_0075_0000$$$::[whitecircle]/[whitecircle] Weather: Sunny [whitestar][whitestar][whitestar][whitestar][whitestar][whitestar][whitestar][lr]::
12610::$$$message_0099_0075_0001$$$::My brother today.[lr]::
12611::$$$message_0099_0075_0002$$$::He's boycotting cleaning the bathtub. I can't forgive him.::
12612::$$$message_0099_0076_0000$$$::[whitecircle]/[whitecircle] Weather: Sunny [whitestar][whitestar][whitestar][whitestar][whitestar][lr]::
12613::$$$message_0099_0076_0001$$$::My grandfather today.[lr]::
12614::$$$message_0099_0076_0002$$$::He left one grain of rice. I can't forgive him.::
12615::$$$message_0099_0077_0000$$$::[whitecircle]/[whitecircle] Weather: Sunny [whitestar][whitestar][whitestar][whitestar][whitestar][whitestar][whitestar][whitestar][whitestar][lr]::
12616::$$$message_0099_0077_0001$$$::My brother today.[lr]::
12617::$$$message_0099_0077_0002$$$::He leaves magazines lying around after reading them. I can't forgive him.[lr]::
12618::$$$message_0099_0077_0003$$$::[whitecircle]/[whitecircle] Weather: Sunny [whitestar][whitestar][whitestar][whitestar][whitestar][whitestar][whitestar][whitestar][whitestar][lr]::
12619::$$$message_0099_0077_0004$$$::My brother today.[lr]::
12620::$$$message_0099_0077_0005$$$::He ate my Hamburg steak. I can't forgive him.[lr]::
12621::$$$message_0099_0077_0006$$$::[whitecircle]/[whitecircle] Weather: Sunny [whitestar][whitestar][whitestar][whitestar][whitestar][whitestar][whitestar][whitestar][whitestar][lr]::
12622::$$$message_0099_0077_0007$$$::My brother today.[lr]::
12623::$$$message_0099_0077_0008$$$::He always leaves his salad. I can't forgive him.[lr]::
12624::$$$message_0099_0077_0009$$$::[whitecircle]/[whitecircle] Weather: Sunny [whitestar][whitestar][whitestar][whitestar][whitestar][whitestar][whitestar][whitestar][whitestar][lr]::
12625::$$$message_0099_0077_0010$$$::My brother today.[lr]::
12626::$$$message_0099_0077_0011$$$::His posture while eating is bad. I really can't forgive him.::
12627::$$$message_0099_0078_0000$$$::My brother today (I can't forgive him) [nolr]::
12628::$$$message_0099_0078_0001$$$::My brother today (I can't forgive him) [nolr]::
12629::$$$message_0099_0078_0002$$$::My brother today (I can't forgive him) [nolr]::
12630::$$$message_0099_0078_0003$$$::My brother today (I can't forgive him) [nolr]::
12631::$$$message_0099_0078_0004$$$::"...Shinji.[lr]::
12632::$$$message_0099_0078_0005$$$::I'm assuming that your behavior is the main cause more than anything."[lr]::
12633::$$$message_0099_0078_0006$$$::I close the notebook.[lr]::
12634::$$$message_0099_0078_0007$$$::To get ready to sprint, [shock vmax=30 time=600 count=-1]I take a deep breath.::
12635::$$$message_0099_0079_0000$$$::"W-What is it? If you have something to say, say it already."[lr]::
12636::$$$message_0099_0079_0001$$$::"You're right when you said that Sakura is scary. There's nothing I can do anymore."[wvs][sestop time=400 nowait=true]::
12637::$$$message_0099_0080_0000$$$::"T-That's not fair, Emiya...! We're partners in crime at this point, help me think of a way to calm Sakura down!"[lr]::
12638::$$$message_0099_0080_0001$$$::"Sorry, I don't accept things that I can't do![lr]::
12639::$$$message_0099_0080_0002$$$::Also, I don't think it's good for outsiders to meddle in the Matou family's problems[wvl][se volume=50 storage=se120.wav][se storage=se306.wav][playstop time=2000 nowait=1][move textoff=0 time=130 path=(0,0,155)(0,0,55)(0,0,0)(0,0,200)(0,0,155)(0,0,55)(0,0,0) storage=black accel=0][line len=2]Wait, huh?"[lr]::
12640::$$$message_0099_0080_0003$$$::I feel like the sensations in my arms and legs are dull.[lr]::
12641::$$$message_0099_0080_0004$$$::I feel like I have a headache too...::
12642::$$$message_0099_0081_0000$$$::"...Oof... What is this? I feel like..."[lr]::
12643::$$$message_0099_0081_0001$$$::I can't stay standing properly.[lr]::
12644::$$$message_0099_0081_0002$$$::"T-T-The Bounded Field got activated!?[lr]::
12645::$$$message_0099_0081_0003$$$::I-I-I-I-I see, so the switch goes on when you take the notebook and start running...!"::
12646::$$$message_0099_0082_0000$$$::So this abnormality is from the Bounded Field.[lr]::
12647::$$$message_0099_0082_0001$$$::But the door isn't locked.[lr]::
12648::$$$message_0099_0082_0002$$$::If we go out into the hallway before the Bounded Field is fully activated...!::
12649::$$$message_0099_0083_0000$$$::"...Wait... Even if my arms and legs feel dull...something's off..."[lr]::
12650::$$$message_0099_0083_0001$$$::I can't even cover two meters of distance.[lr]::
12651::$$$message_0099_0083_0002$$$::No, it's as if the door is getting farther and farther.::
12652::$$$message_0099_0084_0000$$$::"...O-Ow... It's not like it's a hangover..."[lr]::
12653::$$$message_0099_0084_0001$$$::...Yeah.[lr]::
12654::$$$message_0099_0084_0002$$$::This dizziness is like severe alcoholism, or like I'm tripping out...yeah, that's why the door looked that big.::
12655::$$$message_0099_0085_0000$$$::"Ahahaaa. How fun, Emiya. You cast something on me, didn't you? Hypnotism? Endorphin? Wowww, coolll, this room is getting biggerrr."::
12656::$$$message_0099_0086_0000$$$::Shinji is already feeling it. [lr]::
12657::$$$message_0099_0086_0001$$$::I seeee, so we're not getting farther, but the room is getting biggerrr. Nooo, Shinji is getting smaller toooo. Ahhh, I can't easily get to the hallway like thisss.[lr]::
12658::$$$message_0099_0086_0002$$$::...Wait, what was that sound?::
12659::$$$message_0099_0087_0000$$$::"Heyyy, Shinjiii. What do you think that sound wasss?"[lr]::
12660::$$$message_0099_0087_0001$$$::I can't. I can't speak clearly.[lr]::
12661::$$$message_0099_0087_0002$$$::This is a hallucination. Everything is only a hallucination, but I can't fight back because it's directly affecting my central nervous system.[lr]::
12662::$$$message_0099_0087_0003$$$::There's no doubt that it was Rider's idea... She mixed cursed eye patterns into the room's wallpaper and made it so that you'd fall into the spell just by opening your eyes.::
12663::$$$message_0099_0088_0000$$$::"Stupid Emiya. That was the sound of the door, of course it's the sound of Sakura coming homeee."[lr]::
12664::$$$message_0099_0088_0001$$$::"I seeee. It has been thirty minutes alreadyyy."::
12665::$$$message_0099_0089_0000$$$::We both laugh.[lr]::
12666::$$$message_0099_0089_0001$$$::Our heads are spinning so much, the two of us intruders don't really care what's happening or what we were doing.[lr]::
12667::$$$message_0099_0089_0002$$$::I hear footsteps slowly going up the stairs.::
12668::$$$message_0099_0090_0000$$$::"Heh...hehehehe. There are some troublesome people who would go inside a teenage girl's room without permission.[lr]::
12669::$$$message_0099_0090_0001$$$::How embarrassing. I can't forgive you even if we're siblings[heart]"::
12670::$$$message_0099_0091_0000$$$::Danger. Danger.[lr]::
12671::$$$message_0099_0091_0001$$$::An inconcealable angry aura is mixed into her unnatural ramblings. ::
12672::$$$message_0099_0092_0000$$$::"..."[lr]::
12673::$$$message_0099_0092_0001$$$::I sober up.[lr]::
12674::$$$message_0099_0092_0002$$$::My arms and legs are still dull, but my reasoning has returned to normal.::
12675::$$$message_0099_0093_0000$$$::"Shinji, let's run!"[lr]::
12676::$$$message_0099_0093_0001$$$::I take Shinji, who's rolling on the floor laughing, by the hand and run towards the door.[lr]::
12677::$$$message_0099_0093_0002$$$::My head is going to explode, I feel like everything's going to explode from being soaked in alcohol.[lr]::
12678::$$$message_0099_0093_0003$$$::A death sentence that starts to get closer and closer.::
12679::$$$message_0099_0094_0000$$$::"Wahahahaha! This is out of this world, man! [cacheimage storage=慎二制服03b(中),慎二制服01d(中)][wvl canskip=0 time=300][rep textoff=0 avoid=1 fliplr=0 storages=慎二制服03b(中),慎二制服01d(中) time=300 opacities=150,150 flipud=0 poss=rc,lc indexes=1000,2000]By the way, Emiya, I've decided that Del Monte ketchup is the best. [wvl canskip=0 time=300]Yet freaking Sakura bought ketchup from Seikyo [cacheimage storage=慎二制服02c(中),慎二制服05b(近)][wvl][rep textoff=0 avoid=1 fliplr=0 storages=慎二制服02c(中),慎二制服05b(近) opacities=150,150 time=300 flipud=0 poss=lc,rc indexes=1000,2000]but dammit, it's good, I'm seeing Seikyo's ketchup in a new light! [cacheimage storage=慎二制服07a本無(遠),慎二制服01d(中)][wvl canskip=0 time=300][rep textoff=0 avoid=1 fliplr=0 storages=慎二制服07a本無(遠),慎二制服01d(中) opacities=150,150 time=300 flipud=0 poss=rc,lc indexes=1000,2000]But I can't admit it, since I'm the Prince of the Stars! There's no way I can accept the commoners' tasteee."::
12680::$$$message_0099_0095_0000$$$::Shinji is panicking.[lr]::
12681::$$$message_0099_0095_0001$$$::It's no good.[lr]::
12682::$$$message_0099_0095_0002$$$::My life flashes before my eyes.::
12683::$$$message_0099_0096_0000$$$::"...This is a sudden question, but...[lr]::
12684::$$$message_0099_0096_0001$$$::May I ask what is going on with the Matou family that has had their excellent housekeeper, known as Sakura, monopolized by the Emiya house?"::
12685::$$$message_0099_0097_0000$$$::Not "may I ask"...![lr]::
12686::$$$message_0099_0097_0001$$$::Ugh, why did I ask something like that? I'm such an idiot!::
12687::$$$message_0099_0098_0000$$$::"Oh? I thought it was just Shinji, but there's an unexpected person joining in."[lr]::
12688::$$$message_0099_0098_0001$$$::Sakura smiles.[lr]::
12689::$$$message_0099_0098_0002$$$::The glint in her eye is like Rider's Mystic Eyes. Even if my five senses weren't numb, there's no doubt that it would have the same amount of intensity.::
12690::$$$message_0099_0099_0000$$$::"Well, Sakura, there's a lot to preface this with."[lr]::
12691::$$$message_0099_0099_0001$$$::"I'm surprised. I didn't think that you would join Shinji and sneak into my room. I would usually be happy, but I'm a bit sad right now."[lr]::
12692::$$$message_0099_0099_0002$$$::She's not even listening.[lr]::
12693::$$$message_0099_0099_0003$$$::Sakura makes the ground shake and picks up the diary-like notebook.::
12694::$$$message_0099_0100_0000$$$::"Shinji? I'll endure other things, but I told you to not go inside my room, right?"[lr]::
12695::$$$message_0099_0100_0001$$$::She glares.::
12696::$$$message_0099_0101_0000$$$::"Oh, well, I don't know, it probably went in one ear and out the other."[lr]::
12697::$$$message_0099_0101_0001$$$::Shinji must've sobered up mentally, as he's trembling in fear.::
12698::$$$message_0099_0102_0000$$$::"I told you. I wrote it in this notebook.[lr]::
12699::$$$message_0099_0102_0001$$$::'[whitecircle]/[whitecircle]. Weather: Sunny. [whitestar][whitestar][whitestar][whitestar][whitestar][whitestar][whitestar][lr]::
12700::$$$message_0099_0102_0002$$$::Here is what happened today. I told Shinji not to go in my room, but he brushed it off. I'll give him an ultimatum.'[lr]::
12701::$$$message_0099_0102_0003$$$::See? [cacheimage storage=黒衣桜03d(中),o桜ホラー背景-(真紅)][wvl canskip=0 time=600][rep textoff=0 fliplr=0 storages=黒衣桜03d(中) time=300 flipud=0 poss=c bg=o桜ホラー背景-(真紅) indexes=1000]I'm not remembering wrong."::
12702::$$$message_0099_0103_0000$$$::Sakura laughs happily.[lr]::
12703::$$$message_0099_0103_0001$$$::I wonder what the [whitestar] symbol in her diary means.::
12704::$$$message_0099_0104_0000$$$::"Yeah, I remember now. Of course I remembered, hahaha.[lr]::
12705::$$$message_0099_0104_0001$$$::But it's terrible, Sakura.[lr]::
12706::$$$message_0099_0104_0002$$$::I said that we should stop, but Emiya said we should investigate your room and wouldn't listen!"[lr]::
12707::$$$message_0099_0104_0003$$$::"Wha...!"[lr]::
12708::$$$message_0099_0104_0004$$$::Not bad, activating the Emiya shield at this point...!::
12709::$$$message_0099_0105_0000$$$::"You always have impressive counterattacks, Shinji! You're the one who said you wanted to see Sakura's diary!"[lr]::
12710::$$$message_0099_0105_0001$$$::"Me!? What!? Only the main character would do such a daredevil thing! It's a tradition to get a dead end by investigating the heroine's room while she's gone![lr]::
12711::$$$message_0099_0105_0002$$$::The only ones who would do that are the ones who don't die even if they die!"::
12712::$$$message_0099_0106_0000$$$::"Your magical words are full of conviction! But that's unsightly, Shinji. Your ending is decided, so go die by yourself like a man! Don't involve your friend!"[lr]::
12713::$$$message_0099_0106_0001$$$::"Wrong! You're not a friend![lr]::
12714::$$$message_0099_0106_0002$$$::Die with me as my confidant!"[cacheimage storage=hf_怒マーク][wvs][fg opacity=0 left=412 index=3000 top=39 time=100 storage=hf_怒マーク][move spread=1 mx=454 magnify=1.7 time=100 my=83 path=(454,83,255,0.8)(454,83,255,1) storage=hf_怒マーク accel=0][wm canskip=0][texton]::
12715::$$$message_0099_0107_0000$$$::Shinji, who has fallen into a panic, is invincible.[lr]::
12716::$$$message_0099_0107_0001$$$::He won't let go of my arm no matter how much I try to shake him off.[lr]::
12717::$$$message_0099_0107_0002$$$::Wait, a shadow! Sakura's shadow is stretching!::
12718::$$$message_0099_0108_0000$$$::"Khh, I can't neglect you as my confidant. I can't, but I want you to give it up! It's obvious whose fault this is![lr]::
12719::$$$message_0099_0108_0001$$$::My only sin is going into Sakura's room. You go atone your sins!"::
12720::$$$message_0099_0109_0000$$$::"That's not a sin! I'm just a picky eater! Don't put mini tomatoes in salad, that's just cutting corners!"[lr]::
12721::$$$message_0099_0109_0001$$$::Shinji casually shows how he's particular about food.[lr]::
12722::$$$message_0099_0109_0002$$$::...Well, half of it did seem like that, but I don't think he can make excuses about the other half.::
12723::$$$message_0099_0110_0000$$$::"Give it up, Shinji. Use this opportunity to make a fresh start in life."[lr]::
12724::$$$message_0099_0110_0001$$$::"Yes, Senpai is right. I need you to atone for the sins that are written in this notebook."[lr]::
12725::$$$message_0099_0110_0002$$$::Sakura's shadow captures Shinji.[lr]::
12726::$$$message_0099_0110_0003$$$::Goodbye, Shinji. Our fleeting joint battle was fun, man.::
12727::$$$message_0099_0111_0000$$$::"Don't 'man' me, Emiya! Eeek, bad ending 39!"[lr]::
12728::$$$message_0099_0111_0001$$$::"Now, now, don't be scared. Don't worry, Shinji. It's not like Sakura hates you. She just wants you to mend your ways. She won't go as far as taking your life."::
12729::$$$message_0099_0112_0000$$$::"Hehe. Hehehe. Hehehehehe."[lr]::
12730::$$$message_0099_0112_0001$$$::[font italic=true]...Oh?[font italic=false][lr]::
12731::$$$message_0099_0112_0002$$$::[font italic=true]That's weird. Does Sakura find something funny?[font italic=false]::
12732::$$$message_0099_0113_0000$$$::"Exactly, Senpai. I won't take your lives, I just want you both to mend your ways. [cacheimage storage=黒衣桜02c(中)][wvl canskip=0 time=400][chgfg textoff=0 time=300 storage=黒衣桜02c(中)]So, please brace yourselves."[lr]::
12733::$$$message_0099_0113_0001$$$::"Huh? Your line of thinking is weird, Sakura.[lr]::
12734::$$$message_0099_0113_0002$$$::Shinji is the one who should brace himself, I'm not that much at fault."::
12735::$$$message_0099_0114_0000$$$::"You are. Your lifestyle is wayyy more problematic than Shinji's depending on the way you look at it."[lr]::
12736::$$$message_0099_0114_0001$$$::Then...[lr]::
12737::$$$message_0099_0114_0002$$$::Sakura takes out something familiar...::
12738::$$$message_0099_0115_0000$$$::"AHHH! That's the legendary assassination book...![lr]::
12739::$$$message_0099_0115_0001$$$::Y-Y-Y-You had one moreee!?"[lr]::
12740::$$$message_0099_0115_0002$$$::"Yes, of course. It's not just me; Saber, Nee-san, and Illya also write in this [heart]"::
12741::$$$message_0099_0116_0000$$$::The shadow comes closer.[lr]::
12742::$$$message_0099_0116_0001$$$::My confidant grabs my left ankle as I try to run.::
12743::$$$message_0099_0117_0000$$$::"Hey, [wvl][shock vmax=10 time=300 count=-4]you were still alive, Shinji...!?"[lr]::
12744::$$$message_0099_0117_0001$$$::"H-Heheh, heheheh... Don't worry, Emiya. Sakura isn't a demon. You're the one who said she won't go as far as taking your life, right?"::
12745::$$$message_0099_0118_0000$$$::"She will! She definitely will! You don't know what desperate Sakura is like when she bursts! Fine, I'm also guilty, [wvl][shock vmax=20 hmax=20 time=2000 count=-12]I'm also guilty, so lettt meee gooo!"[lr]::
12746::$$$message_0099_0118_0001$$$::"It's too late. C'mon, let's die together once in a while, Emiya! Oh, come to think of it, it seems like it's my fate to die in Sakura's room."::
12747::$$$message_0099_0119_0000$$$::Imagine what it's like having to accompany that fate.[lr]::
12748::$$$message_0099_0119_0001$$$::...Ah, my head is spinning.[lr]::
12749::$$$message_0099_0119_0002$$$::Ugh, I didn't think that legendary and absurd dead end would be prepared here...::
12750::$$$message_0099_0120_0000$$$::"...Huh!?"[lr]::
12751::$$$message_0099_0120_0001$$$::I suddenly wake up.[lr]::
12752::$$$message_0099_0120_0002$$$::When I check the time as if being hurried, it's already past 12 AM.::
12753::$$$message_0099_0121_0000$$$::"...Wow, I'm sweating so much..."[lr]::
12754::$$$message_0099_0121_0001$$$::My whole body has broken out in a cold sweat.[lr]::
12755::$$$message_0099_0121_0002$$$::[font italic=true]Did I have a really bad nightmare?[font italic=false][lr]::
12756::$$$message_0099_0121_0003$$$::I shake my pounding head and try to remember what it was about, but...::
12757::$$$message_0099_0122_0000$$$::"...Never mind. It probably wasn't anything good."[lr]::
12758::$$$message_0099_0122_0001$$$::I collapse onto my bed.[lr]::
12759::$$$message_0099_0122_0002$$$::I have to wake up early tomorrow. I should pretend like that nightmare didn't happen and go back to sleep...[lr]::
12760::$$$message_0099_0122_0003$$$::"...Heh. [wvl canskip=0 time=500]Heheheh, [wvl canskip=0 time=300]heheheheheheh..."[wm canskip=0][rf]::
12761::$$$message_0099_0123_0000$$$::"Wait, [wvl][se storage=se216.wav][shock vmax=25 time=2000 count=30]AHHHHHHHHH!?!?!?"[lr]::
12762::$$$message_0099_0123_0001$$$::I-[shock vmax=25 time=2000 count=30]IT WASN'T A DREAAAM...!::
912444::$$$message_9099_0030_0000$$$::"O-Okay, I got it, so let go!"[r]::

